# Game 2 of a match with the human as the loser: human decides and chooses to
# go first (queue startingplayer human), then the London mulligan runs as in
# game 1. The ai keeps seven; the human mulligans once and keeps, putting one
# card on the bottom of the library (CR 103.5, a card back for the mulligan).
queue startingplayer human
dealopeninghands after human
